s/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2019 Q2","e":"ar","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"Now let's turn to our well cost-savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2019 Q3","e":"ar","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"In my comments, I will provide an update on the considerable progress we've already made on our well cost savings initiative.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2019 Q3","e":"ar","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"I'd like to start by discussing the expansive cost savings efforts under way at Antero.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2019 Q4","e":"ar","d":"2020-02-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"Yeah, I would say it's not lower tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2019 Q4","e":"ar","d":"2020-02-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"The tariffs are FERC regulated, so we have offloaded some and we've announced that I think in the fourth quarter and earlier, we do what are called asset management agreements, they're FERC regulated, but AMAs where a third-party or marketing party might take the transportation path off our hands…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2019 Q4","e":"ar","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"In my comments, I'll begin with an update on the continued momentum around our internal cost savings initiatives, including our lower well cost targets for 2020, and then Glen will highlight our balance sheet and liquidity position and provide a brief update on our ongoing asset monetization…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2019 Q4","e":"ar","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"Let's start by discussing the cost reduction momentum across all of Antero's cost structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2020 Q1","e":"ar","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"Let's start by discussing the cost reduction momentum across all of Antero's cost structure detailed on slide number three, titled Cost Reduction Momentum.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2020 Q1","e":"ar","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"Over half of AR's reductions are expected to come from lower well costs as we have driven a $3 million per well cost reduction in 2020 relative to our initial 2019 budget.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2020 Q2","e":"ar","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"Now let's turn to our progress in reducing Antero's cost structure, which is detailed on slide number 3 titled Cost Reduction Momentum.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/antero-resources-corporation-ar-q2-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"AR 2020 Q2","e":"ar","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"Over half of AR's cost savings in 2020 are expected to come from lower well costs, as we have driven a $3.